# ATK DECK V2 — MASTER PERSONAL TRADING JOURNAL SYSTEM

## PROJECT IDENTITY

**Product Name:** ATK Deck  
**Version:** Version 2  
**Product Type:** Personal Trading Journal and Performance Management System  
**Owner:** ATK Deck  
**Primary Purpose:** Personal trading, session management, trade recording, psychology tracking, discipline measurement and performance analytics.

## CORE PROJECT VISION

Build a complete personal trading journal called ATK Deck V2.

The application must reproduce the complete functionality, design language, page structure, workflows and user experience of the existing Hyper Tracker Commercial application.

The commercial version is the reference product and visual source of truth.

I want the personal version to have the same product experience, but without commercial functionality.

This is not a simplified trading journal.

It must retain the complete trading functionality of the commercial application.

The most important architectural requirement is that the application must have a permanent, portable and independently managed personal data system.

I must be able to:

- Publish new versions without losing personal data.
- Rebuild the frontend without resetting the database.
- Change hosting providers without losing data.
- Export my complete trading history.
- Import that history into another compatible application.
- Move from ATK Deck Personal to Hyper Tracker Commercial.
- Move from Hyper Tracker Commercial to ATK Deck Personal.
- Keep both applications completely independent.
- Never require a live connection between the two applications.

**The data must belong to the user, not to a particular website, frontend, hosting provider or application deployment.**

